{"5352520":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Doomlander","steam_appid":5352520,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game story:<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Player character is Doomlander super soldier in this Retro style FPS game. Player main mission is to find stars in 6 different maps. Finding stars will finish level. Side mission is to find gold piles which gives steam achievements. Every level contain 1 golden pile. There are 3 different enemies melee enemy, shooting big brain monster and shooting warrior enemy. Levels start that player has only 1 weapon pistol, during levels player can collect different weapons like chainsaw melee weapon and several different weapons like machine gun, shotgun, electric gun. Every weapon has limited ammos so be careful which weapon use. Levels contain blue and red doors. Opening those doors need finding keys. Red door can open by finding red key and blue doors by finding blue keys. So be doomlander hero and kill all enemies and find stars every level in this retro styled FPS shooter game<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 different themed levels<br>- Melee weapons like chainsaw<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro style enemies and weapons like original doom<br>- Weapons like : Shotgun,Pistol,Rocket launcher, electronic gun, machine gun etc<br>- Door that can open with finding keys<br>- 3 enemies: Melee warrior, Shooting monster and  Flamethrower enemy<br>- Steam achievements by finding golden piles<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game story:<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Player character is Doomlander super soldier in this Retro style FPS game. Player main mission is to find stars in 6 different maps. Finding stars will finish level. Side mission is to find gold piles which gives steam achievements. Every level contain 1 golden pile. There are 3 different enemies melee enemy, shooting big brain monster and shooting warrior enemy. Levels start that player has only 1 weapon pistol, during levels player can collect different weapons like chainsaw melee weapon and several different weapons like machine gun, shotgun, electric gun. Every weapon has limited ammos so be careful which weapon use. Levels contain blue and red doors. Opening those doors need finding keys. Red door can open by finding red key and blue doors by finding blue keys. So be doomlander hero and kill all enemies and find stars every level in this retro styled FPS shooter game<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 different themed levels<br>- Melee weapons like chainsaw<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro style enemies and weapons like original doom<br>- Weapons like : Shotgun,Pistol,Rocket launcher, electronic gun, machine gun etc<br>- Door that can open with finding keys<br>- 3 enemies: Melee warrior, Shooting monster and  Flamethrower enemy<br>- Steam achievements by finding golden piles<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Retro style FPS game where Doomlander hero mission to kill several enemies and find gold piles and star in different levels","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5352520\/25a623139cb4c0ffcee70e9f59b66942feeacb04\/header.jpg?t=1792165008","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5352520\/e03b2135a71091f50f6141de59ca5f233e30aacf\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792165008","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5352520\/e03b2135a71091f50f6141de59ca5f233e30aacf\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792165008","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> i5